    "tMinCopy": {
      "x": 3380,
      "y": 8168,
      "w": 420,
      "maxH": 700,
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "NEW (KJ, 28 Oct)\n\n· Bubble replaces the pill everywhere, chat included.\n· Tap = back to voice. Drag = move, snaps to the side. Drop on the cross = End.\n· Needs you: bubble turns attention + label. Mel also says it.\n· Dashboard and Clients are grey skeletons, not real pages.\n\nCopy not from Biju: \"Draft ready\", \"Drop to end\".\n\nPrototype: tap minimise, tap Dashboard or Clients in the nav, drag the bubble. After 6s Mel flags the draft."
    },
    "bgProto": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "text": "Background states · prototype",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 860,
      "page": "bg"
    },
    "bgCopy": {
      "x": 940,
      "y": 260,
      "w": 440,
      "maxH": 800,
      "fill": "orange",
      "page": "bg",
      "text": "NEW (KJ, 28 Oct) · iOS only\n\nPrototype: island starts live. Tap island = expand. Tap wallpaper = collapse. Mute toggles. End = Voice ended, then hides. Talk to Mel widget = start again. After ~9s Mel needs you; Open goes to the voice prototype.\n\n· Mel Brand Guidelines only (KJ, 28 Oct): marks = 07 Mel in motion per state (listening, working, speaking, done, needs you = Deep Teal + mint, paused = grey). Open / Open chat / Try again = 08 Accent button (green, Deep Teal label). Mute = brand outline/secondary. End stays red (approved earlier, not in brand file). No skill teal.\n· ↳ rows in widgets: tap = open chat + send.\n· Mini Dot field in the island: out = speaking, in = listening, slow = working.\n· Lock screen widgets render monochrome on iOS, so no green there.\n· App icons + dock are grey skeletons.\n\nCopy not from Biju: Draft ready, Voice ended, Reconnecting, Stopped, 42/120, 120 added, Importing clients, Checking for duplicates, Import stopped, Row 65 has no name or email…, 120 clients added, Import done, Open, Open chat, Try again, Ask Mel, Opens chat, Talk to Mel, Starts voice, Mel suggests, 3 clients need a follow-up today, Nothing due today, Ask me anything, or talk to me, 2 follow-ups today, all widget ↳ prompts."
    },
